    "body": "I can confirm @spf13 's issue.\r\n\r\n```sh\r\n# using bash from git-with-openssh, installed via scoop\r\n$ gcm git\r\nCommandType     Name        Version      Source\r\n-----------     ----        -------      ------\r\nApplication     git.exe     2.29.2.2     C:\\Users\\asaaki\\scoop\\apps\\git-with-openssh\\current\\bin\\git.exe\r\n```\r\n\r\n* Starship: 0.47.0\r\n* Shell type: bash\r\n* Shell version: 4.4.23(1)-release (x86_64-pc-msys)\r\n* Terminal Emulator(s): Windows Terminal (1.4.3141.0), PowerShellCore 6 (stock Win 10)\r\n* OS: Windows 10.0.19042 Build 19042\r\n\r\nNeither PowerShell(Core) nor Windows Terminal (1.4.3141.0) provide the right environment for the bash.\r\n",
